      "lineNbr": 6319,
      "author": {
        "id": 1004034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-03-07T08:14:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We set the following jgit options on NFS:\n```\n[core]\n    supportsAtomicFileCreation \u003d false\n    trustFolderStat \u003d false\n    trustLooseRefStat \u003d after_open\n    trustPackedRefsStat \u003d after_open\n```\n\nas soon as Gerrit uses\nhttps://eclipse.gerrithub.io/c/eclipse-jgit/jgit/+/1206686\nthis can be simplified to\n```\n[core]\n    supportsAtomicFileCreation \u003d false\n    trustStat \u003d after_open\n```\n\nthe detailed options can be used to tweak the default set by `core.trustStat` for individual file types:\n```\ncore.trustLooseRefStat \ncore.trustPackedRefsStat\ncore.trustLooseObjectStat\ncore.trustPackStat\n```\n\nhttps://eclipse.gerrithub.io/c/eclipse-jgit/jgit/+/1206684 introduces an additional option `core.trustTablesListStat` used to configure how `FileReftableDatabase` shall handle file attributes of `tables.list` file containing the list of `RefTable` filenames. I will soon push another change letting this also inherit from `core.trustStat` like the other trust options.\n\nSee https://github.com/eclipse-jgit/jgit/blob/refs/heads/master/Documentation/config-options.md",
      "parentUuid": "f8a320b7_4e6bdcc4",
      "revId": "f8c01f95675120f5086f015517e08078e84b192e",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "11e0180b_de3b37c8",
        "filename": "Documentation/config-gerrit.txt",
