      "writtenOn": "2025-03-07T08:20:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I checked and found that `core.trustTablesListStat` already inherits from `core.trustStat` :-). This means setting `core.trustStat` also sets the default for `core.trustTablesListStat`.",
